{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22772","headline":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 三 · 白居易","name":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人稀地僻医巫少，夏旱秋霖瘴疟多。\n老去一身须爱惜，别来四体得如何。\n侏儒饱笑东方朔，薏苡谗忧马伏波。\n莫遣沈愁结成病，时时一唱濯缨歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}